(3866347, 547070, 79847, '<td valign="top">The colour is so strong in this picture that it looks like a painting rather than a real picture.</td>', 'The colour is so strong in this picture that it looks like a painting rather than a real picture.', '2007-07-04 08:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
