(3866355, 546843, 33736, '<td valign="top">The small area of blur (bottom right) bothers me - not enough to be a DOF issue imo.  However, As a whole I rather loved this image! 8</td>', 'The small area of blur (bottom right) bothers me - not enough to be a DOF issue imo.  However, As a whole I rather loved this image! 8', '2007-07-04 08:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3866358, 547985, 33736, '<td valign="top">Normally, this would look a little too much "split down the middle". However, who would want to lose those clouds, or the ripples in the wheat? Sepia was a terrific choice for this one.</td>', 'Normally, this would look a little too much "split down the middle". However, who would want to lose those clouds, or the ripples in the wheat? Sepia was a terrific choice for this one.', '2007-07-04 08:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3866360, 544919, 33736, '<td valign="top">The coloring looks a little odd (seeing fringing above the trees.)</td>', 'The coloring looks a little odd (seeing fringing above the trees.)', '2007-07-04 08:11:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3866382, 548095, 33736, '<td valign="top">The puzzle effect just lost me. I couldn''t tell if your image was well-shot, or not.  Also, I would have cropped it from the bottom, at the very least.</td>', 'The puzzle effect just lost me. I couldn''t tell if your image was well-shot, or not.  Also, I would have cropped it from the bottom, at the very least.', '2007-07-04 08:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3866390, 547905, 33736, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites (loved the angle,) Wishing the hiker weren''t quite so centered, but loved the inclusion of a human figure for perspective. 8</td>', 'One of my favorites (loved the angle,) Wishing the hiker weren''t quite so centered, but loved the inclusion of a human figure for perspective. 8', '2007-07-04 08:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3866397, 548093, 33736, '<td valign="top">Perhaps if shot a little more off-center (at a more dramatic angle.)</td>', 'Perhaps if shot a little more off-center (at a more dramatic angle.)', '2007-07-04 08:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3866404, 547432, 33736, '<td valign="top">The Falls are dramatic enough, without shooting at an artificial angle.</td>', 'The Falls are dramatic enough, without shooting at an artificial angle.', '2007-07-04 08:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3866415, 546680, 33736, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped more from the top, so that the wall didn''t run off quite as much dead-corner. (and more from the right - too much unnecessary fence and greenery.)  However, on the whole, this is nicely composed. It''s different, and I like it.</td>', 'I would have cropped more from the top, so that the wall didn''t run off quite as much dead-corner. (and more from the right - too much unnecessary fence and greenery.)  However, on the whole, this is nicely composed. It''s different, and I like it.', '2007-07-04 08:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3866419, 548037, 33736, '<td valign="top">Yes....... This is on the land.  But, it feels as though you missed the point of the challenge entirely.  Would you look at this and honestly say, "What a beautiful Landscape"????</td>', 'Yes....... This is on the land.  But, it feels as though you missed the point of the challenge entirely.  Would you look at this and honestly say, "What a beautiful Landscape"????', '2007-07-04 08:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3866422, 546515, 33736, '<td valign="top">Nice landscape, but that horizon really needs leveling off.</td>', 'Nice landscape, but that horizon really needs leveling off.', '2007-07-04 08:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3866425, 547524, 33736, '<td valign="top">What a lovely Floral. 2</td>', 'What a lovely Floral. 2', '2007-07-04 08:32:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3866430, 546274, 33736, '<td valign="top">The tones seem a little murky, and there seems to be a sunflare to the left (over part of the sign and clouds.) 4</td>', 'The tones seem a little murky, and there seems to be a sunflare to the left (over part of the sign and clouds.) 4', '2007-07-04 08:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3866433, 547809, 33736, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful image, but there seems to be a lot of "Noise", especially in the sky. 6</td>', 'It''s a beautiful image, but there seems to be a lot of "Noise", especially in the sky. 6', '2007-07-04 08:35:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3866437, 547602, 33736, '<td valign="top">This almost looks like a blended photo. How DID you achieve that translucent look to the Mountains?  It''s kind of neat.</td>', 'This almost looks like a blended photo. How DID you achieve that translucent look to the Mountains?  It''s kind of neat.', '2007-07-04 08:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3866459, 547689, 33736, '<td valign="top">There was so much "sea" in this Yin-Yan image, that I almost missed your Title-Point (the footprint?)  It would have had more of an impact on me, had the water been less than 1/3 of the area (just enough to define the scene and the story.)</td>', 'There was so much "sea" in this Yin-Yan image, that I almost missed your Title-Point (the footprint?)  It would have had more of an impact on me, had the water been less than 1/3 of the area (just enough to define the scene and the story.)', '2007-07-04 08:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3866466, 546274, 70661, '<td valign="top">I kind of like your processing. Makes it stand out. I would have scored it a little higher if there wasn''t that arch of light on and to the left of the sign.</td>', 'I kind of like your processing. Makes it stand out. I would have scored it a little higher if there wasn''t that arch of light on and to the left of the sign.', '2007-07-04 08:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3866468, 547148, 33736, '<td valign="top">And the land part is.....? I felt the Wheel overpowers the concept of Land.</td>', 'And the land part is.....? I felt the Wheel overpowers the concept of Land.', '2007-07-04 08:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3866471, 547254, 33736, '<td valign="top">Amusing Title!</td>', 'Amusing Title!', '2007-07-04 08:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3866473, 546047, 33736, '<td valign="top">I wish you had rotated it a bit, but lovely, nonetheless.</td>', 'I wish you had rotated it a bit, but lovely, nonetheless.', '2007-07-04 08:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3866476, 547144, 33736, '<td valign="top">The shadows are a lovely contrast (but am not thrilled to see a signature.)</td>', 'The shadows are a lovely contrast (but am not thrilled to see a signature.)', '2007-07-04 08:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3866479, 547510, 33736, '<td valign="top">Seeing a bit of fringing and blotchiness - maybe overly saturated? Pretty scene, though.</td>', 'Seeing a bit of fringing and blotchiness - maybe overly saturated? Pretty scene, though.', '2007-07-04 08:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3866483, 544880, 33736, '<td valign="top">The small bush in the foreground (especially, dead-center) was bothersome for me.</td>', 'The small bush in the foreground (especially, dead-center) was bothersome for me.', '2007-07-04 08:57:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3866487, 547877, 33736, '<td valign="top">Perhaps, too centered - with the horizon seeming to be tilted downward a bit to the Right.</td>', 'Perhaps, too centered - with the horizon seeming to be tilted downward a bit to the Right.', '2007-07-04 08:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3866495, 547233, 33736, '<td valign="top">I''m scoring this low for several reasons: The "dramatic" angle was unneccessary. The diagonal goes directly into the corner. The contrast is flat. That bit of bush to the left side is an "odd bit" (just there for no reason.)  This sounds harsh, but learning composition and adjustments of colors and light are critical.</td>', 'I''m scoring this low for several reasons: The "dramatic" angle was unneccessary. The diagonal goes directly into the corner. The contrast is flat. That bit of bush to the left side is an "odd bit" (just there for no reason.)  This sounds harsh, but learning composition and adjustments of colors and light are critical.', '2007-07-04 09:03:40.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3866498, 547390, 33736, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful image, but almost too 1/2 and 1/2. Perhaps, more of the sky and less of the vines would have increased the overall impact.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful image, but almost too 1/2 and 1/2. Perhaps, more of the sky and less of the vines would have increased the overall impact.', '2007-07-04 09:05:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3866504, 548067, 33736, '<td valign="top">The tones are murky / the contrast harsh. and the meaning of your title eludes me completely.</td>', 'The tones are murky / the contrast harsh. and the meaning of your title eludes me completely.', '2007-07-04 09:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3866510, 548060, 33736, '<td valign="top">Now, THIS is Land! Well-done.</td>', 'Now, THIS is Land! Well-done.', '2007-07-04 09:08:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3866517, 547108, 33736, '<td valign="top">Too 1/2 and 1/2 in the composition, and it seems to need some rotation for the horizon. However, it''s a terrific image.</td>', 'Too 1/2 and 1/2 in the composition, and it seems to need some rotation for the horizon. However, it''s a terrific image.', '2007-07-04 09:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3866519, 547843, 33736, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites. Gentle coloring, without being washed out. Well-done. 8</td>', 'One of my favorites. Gentle coloring, without being washed out. Well-done. 8', '2007-07-04 09:10:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3866526, 548046, 33736, '<td valign="top">This appears to be overly saturated, which makes the blown-out area of the sky (huge and centered, no less!) conspicuous.</td>', 'This appears to be overly saturated, which makes the blown-out area of the sky (huge and centered, no less!) conspicuous.', '2007-07-04 09:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3866537, 547965, 49109, '<td valign="top">had not cropped the building at left. overall lack of impact, maybe more saturation could help</td>', 'had not cropped the building at left. overall lack of impact, maybe more saturation could help', '2007-07-04 09:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3866540, 547960, 33736, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous!</td>', 'Gorgeous!', '2007-07-04 09:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3866541, 547254, 62626, '<td valign="top">Interesting mountains!</td>', 'Interesting mountains!', '2007-07-04 09:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
