(3867599, 547657, 15711, '<td valign="top">This has such a Texas feel to it.  I drive around and see this type image all the time and love it.  Great coposition. Too bad we couldn''t have had adv. editing and you could doge the whites of the upper clouds a bit.  Nice. 7</td>', 'This has such a Texas feel to it.  I drive around and see this type image all the time and love it.  Great coposition. Too bad we couldn''t have had adv. editing and you could doge the whites of the upper clouds a bit.  Nice. 7', '2007-07-04 13:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
