(3867825, 547432, 34659, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture - and I like the tilt - but looks like a large body of water to me (going against the grain of the "Land" challenge because water takes up more than 50% of the real estate).  Still a great shot.</td>', 'Beautiful capture - and I like the tilt - but looks like a large body of water to me (going against the grain of the "Land" challenge because water takes up more than 50% of the real estate).  Still a great shot.', '2007-07-04 14:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
