(3868911, 547434, 7786, '<td valign="top">Good picture in general but it lacks sharpness to make it all the way. I usually use apply Unsharp Mask after I resize my pictures (radius=0,4-0,6 strength=150-250).</td>', 'Good picture in general but it lacks sharpness to make it all the way. I usually use apply Unsharp Mask after I resize my pictures (radius=0,4-0,6 strength=150-250).', '2007-07-04 20:00:29.000000', NULL, 1),
