(3878922, 548071, 43088, '<td valign="top">Minimalism.  To bad basic doesn''t let you get rid of the power lines. I would like more sky in it.</td>', 'Minimalism.  To bad basic doesn''t let you get rid of the power lines. I would like more sky in it.', '2007-07-07 18:04:04.000000', NULL, 1),
