(3882224, 547386, 81005, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid the composition just doesn''t do it for me.  I wonder what the significance of the road was to you?  It''s difficult to say without seeing it, but I suspect that you might had a more powerful image if you had centered the "crop" line, and removed most, if not all of the road from view.</td>', 'I''m afraid the composition just doesn''t do it for me.  I wonder what the significance of the road was to you?  It''s difficult to say without seeing it, but I suspect that you might had a more powerful image if you had centered the "crop" line, and removed most, if not all of the road from view.', '2007-07-08 15:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3882246, 544880, 81005, '<td valign="top">Surely this is Alaska, yes?  Right along the New Seward Highway?  I''ve always thought those Suess-esque trees deserved a wider audience.<br/> <br/>Nice picture, but I think that little bush in the foreground detracts from the image.  Also, I wish the range of colours were a little wider.<br/> <br/>I haven''t tried to shoot here, but the texture of that marsh grass is so neatdid you take other pictures where it stood out more?  I think that would make a pretty interesting shot.</td>', 'Surely this is Alaska, yes?  Right along the New Seward Highway?  I''ve always thought those Suess-esque trees deserved a wider audience. Nice picture, but I think that little bush in the foreground detracts from the image.  Also, I wish the range of colours were a little wider. I haven''t tried to shoot here, but the texture of that marsh grass is so neatdid you take other pictures where it stood out more?  I think that would make a pretty interesting shot.', '2007-07-08 15:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
