(3884891, 548036, 1054, '<td valign="top">David -- not sure how else to reach you so I''ll try this. I sent you a PM but I''m guessing your spam filters ate it.<br/> <br/>Anyway, you won a free DPC membership in the Comments for a Cure contest. See <a href="//dpchallenge.com/forum.php?action=read&amp;FORUM_THREAD_ID=588193" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">this thread</a> for details. Check your spam folder in your email to see if you got my PM with the membership gift certificate codes. If not, send me a PM and I''ll re-send it.</td>', 'David -- not sure how else to reach you so I''ll try this. I sent you a PM but I''m guessing your spam filters ate it. Anyway, you won a free DPC membership in the Comments for a Cure contest. See this thread for details. Check your spam folder in your email to see if you got my PM with the membership gift certificate codes. If not, send me a PM and I''ll re-send it.', '2007-07-09 08:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
