(3885188, 547375, 33657, '<td valign="top">This is really beautiful!! I live in Lancashire and this captures everything about The Pennines. I love the shadows of the clouds at the back with the long brush and heathers blowing in the wind. Anyone who knows Lancashire will appreciate this one!!! WELL DONE</td>', 'This is really beautiful!! I live in Lancashire and this captures everything about The Pennines. I love the shadows of the clouds at the back with the long brush and heathers blowing in the wind. Anyone who knows Lancashire will appreciate this one!!! WELL DONE', '2007-07-09 10:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885705, 547809, 71409, '<td valign="top">Ha! I was driving home from a friend''s yesterday and passed a hay field... was thinking "I bet I could get a good shot out here".<br/> <br/>Anyway, I love the shot.  Has a dramatic, almost abstract feel to it... at the same time looks like little editing was done other than desaturation.</td>', 'Ha! I was driving home from a friend''s yesterday and passed a hay field... was thinking "I bet I could get a good shot out here". Anyway, I love the shot.  Has a dramatic, almost abstract feel to it... at the same time looks like little editing was done other than desaturation.', '2007-07-09 12:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885716, 548021, 71409, '<td valign="top">I like the frame/composition, but wish the whole thing was sharper.  That being said, I think you did a great job capturing the "hilly" landscape without making it look like the camera wasn''t level.</td>', 'I like the frame/composition, but wish the whole thing was sharper.  That being said, I think you did a great job capturing the "hilly" landscape without making it look like the camera wasn''t level.', '2007-07-09 12:54:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885719, 547849, 71931, '<td valign="top">Too much sky for this topic</td>', 'Too much sky for this topic', '2007-07-09 12:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885721, 548105, 71409, '<td valign="top">Nice... dramatic lighting, sepia toning works well for me.  Only critique is I wish the building wasn''t cut off the frame.  I like the detail in the sky and the part of the structure that is visible.</td>', 'Nice... dramatic lighting, sepia toning works well for me.  Only critique is I wish the building wasn''t cut off the frame.  I like the detail in the sky and the part of the structure that is visible.', '2007-07-09 12:55:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885726, 546272, 71931, '<td valign="top">Too much sky for this topic</td>', 'Too much sky for this topic', '2007-07-09 12:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885731, 548043, 43548, '<td valign="top">would have been higher except too much water to truely fit the challenge, to me anyways maybe i''m picky. lovely shot though</td>', 'would have been higher except too much water to truely fit the challenge, to me anyways maybe i''m picky. lovely shot though', '2007-07-09 12:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885735, 548097, 71409, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Thank you for not tilting your camera.  The only critique (or more of an option) I can think of is to crop maybe portrait thru the center (you know, so you get the 3 white objects)... Anyway, cool shot</td>', 'Nice composition.  Thank you for not tilting your camera.  The only critique (or more of an option) I can think of is to crop maybe portrait thru the center (you know, so you get the 3 white objects)... Anyway, cool shot', '2007-07-09 12:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885743, 545734, 71409, '<td valign="top">Kind of interesting shot, but sorry, it just doesn''t look pleasing to me.  Good depth of field and frame, but there''s just nothing nice to look at.  4</td>', 'Kind of interesting shot, but sorry, it just doesn''t look pleasing to me.  Good depth of field and frame, but there''s just nothing nice to look at.  4', '2007-07-09 13:01:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885745, 546274, 71931, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot: great color contrasts.  I wish that it had been cropped so that less sky was showing.  Perhaps you could have adjusted where you were standing, to get a different angle, maybe looking down a bit more.  There''s a lot of potential in this shot, and it might be worth going out to the site again and taking a lot more shots.</td>', 'I really like this shot: great color contrasts.  I wish that it had been cropped so that less sky was showing.  Perhaps you could have adjusted where you were standing, to get a different angle, maybe looking down a bit more.  There''s a lot of potential in this shot, and it might be worth going out to the site again and taking a lot more shots.', '2007-07-09 13:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885753, 547783, 71409, '<td valign="top">I like the frame... gives a feeling of "this is where we are, and thats where we''re going"... Good saturation.  Only critique is I almost which everything was a bit clearer...</td>', 'I like the frame... gives a feeling of "this is where we are, and thats where we''re going"... Good saturation.  Only critique is I almost which everything was a bit clearer...', '2007-07-09 13:03:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885763, 547905, 71931, '<td valign="top">Too much sky!  Marvelous colors, but they are "faded" by lack of a strong focus.  You don''t need all of that blue to make your point, and it pulls the eye away from what should be the focus.  The hiker is too small; zoom in on the hiker more, or crop it down.  This is a nice shot that could have been a great one with a little work.</td>', 'Too much sky!  Marvelous colors, but they are "faded" by lack of a strong focus.  You don''t need all of that blue to make your point, and it pulls the eye away from what should be the focus.  The hiker is too small; zoom in on the hiker more, or crop it down.  This is a nice shot that could have been a great one with a little work.', '2007-07-09 13:05:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885764, 546408, 71409, '<td valign="top">Weird, almost looks like a miniature landscape.  I don''t like the sharpen lines between the mountains and sky.  Other than that, the colors and frame are pretty nice.</td>', 'Weird, almost looks like a miniature landscape.  I don''t like the sharpen lines between the mountains and sky.  Other than that, the colors and frame are pretty nice.', '2007-07-09 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885775, 547843, 71931, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I really like the cross-patterning.  The cloud shadows add some contrast without being overbearing.  There is just enough sky to tell us about all the clouds, but you didn''t let them be the story.  You even got a house on a "thirds" spot :-)  Excellent shot!</td>', 'Very nice!  I really like the cross-patterning.  The cloud shadows add some contrast without being overbearing.  There is just enough sky to tell us about all the clouds, but you didn''t let them be the story.  You even got a house on a "thirds" spot :-)  Excellent shot!', '2007-07-09 13:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885778, 547843, 71409, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.  One thing that stands out is the detail of the cloud blocking the sun on the ground in the middle.  I think you''ve balanced the frame perfectly.  The differen''t shades of color throughout... the buildings distance helps give an idea of how far you can see from where your standing.</td>', 'I like this a lot.  One thing that stands out is the detail of the cloud blocking the sun on the ground in the middle.  I think you''ve balanced the frame perfectly.  The differen''t shades of color throughout... the buildings distance helps give an idea of how far you can see from where your standing.', '2007-07-09 13:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885793, 547455, 71931, '<td valign="top">Really close to going over the line of having too much water, but I let that pass on my vote due to how you used it. Very nice work :-)</td>', 'Really close to going over the line of having too much water, but I let that pass on my vote due to how you used it. Very nice work :-)', '2007-07-09 13:11:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885794, 547585, 71409, '<td valign="top">Thats pretty cool.  Portrait of a flower... Wish there was a mountain poking up higher into the blue sky mid-left. The one thing that stands out that i''m not fond of is the sharpen lines around the yellow flower, almost looks like it was sharpened to make up for not being perfectly in focus... I wonder if sharpening the whole image would''ve worked better.  Sorry, 4</td>', 'Thats pretty cool.  Portrait of a flower... Wish there was a mountain poking up higher into the blue sky mid-left. The one thing that stands out that i''m not fond of is the sharpen lines around the yellow flower, almost looks like it was sharpened to make up for not being perfectly in focus... I wonder if sharpening the whole image would''ve worked better.  Sorry, 4', '2007-07-09 13:12:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885800, 548078, 71931, '<td valign="top">Very clever!  Using water as land; gotta like that :-)</td>', 'Very clever!  Using water as land; gotta like that :-)', '2007-07-09 13:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885803, 547608, 71409, '<td valign="top">Cool frame... The sunflower sets it off.  I just wish there where a little more detail, and it almost looks like its a little dark (that might just be my screen)...</td>', 'Cool frame... The sunflower sets it off.  I just wish there where a little more detail, and it almost looks like its a little dark (that might just be my screen)...', '2007-07-09 13:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885812, 548020, 71931, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot and completely off-topic.</td>', 'Beautiful shot and completely off-topic.', '2007-07-09 13:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885813, 547318, 71409, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  I like it in b&amp;w... the shadow looks creepy... I like how the image gives a feeling that something bad is coming.</td>', 'Cool shot.  I like it in b&w... the shadow looks creepy... I like how the image gives a feeling that something bad is coming.', '2007-07-09 13:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885819, 545208, 71409, '<td valign="top">I like the orange color from the sunset, thru the sky and on the water.  Nice frame, but shouldn''t this have been in the Sea (not land) challenge?</td>', 'I like the orange color from the sunset, thru the sky and on the water.  Nice frame, but shouldn''t this have been in the Sea (not land) challenge?', '2007-07-09 13:18:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885847, 545851, 71409, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  You did a great job with composition - the slanted lines give a good idea of distance from you and the mountains in the distance.  I also like the natural coloring.  Only critique is I wish it were a bit clearer.</td>', 'Nice shot.  You did a great job with composition - the slanted lines give a good idea of distance from you and the mountains in the distance.  I also like the natural coloring.  Only critique is I wish it were a bit clearer.', '2007-07-09 13:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885855, 548078, 71409, '<td valign="top">That''s pretty sweet.  You''ve giving us a view of something most of us will probably never see with our own eyes.  I find myself wanting to keep looking, and wishing I could be there to see it.  Nice frame &amp; comp - just wish it were a bit clearer, but i''m guessing it was probably a bit foggy or hazy?  Tough one to vote, because even with the haze, I still want to keep looking. 7</td>', 'That''s pretty sweet.  You''ve giving us a view of something most of us will probably never see with our own eyes.  I find myself wanting to keep looking, and wishing I could be there to see it.  Nice frame & comp - just wish it were a bit clearer, but i''m guessing it was probably a bit foggy or hazy?  Tough one to vote, because even with the haze, I still want to keep looking. 7', '2007-07-09 13:31:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885870, 546075, 71409, '<td valign="top">I like the sky in this... however the image almost seems too weighted to the right... like it''s missing something in the distance on the mid-left. Maybe a wider shot with a little more of the tree on the left would help this.  That being said, I do like that you didn''t butcher it with editing (I see no sharpening lines anywhere) I like the detail in the leaves on the left, and the colors look natural.</td>', 'I like the sky in this... however the image almost seems too weighted to the right... like it''s missing something in the distance on the mid-left. Maybe a wider shot with a little more of the tree on the left would help this.  That being said, I do like that you didn''t butcher it with editing (I see no sharpening lines anywhere) I like the detail in the leaves on the left, and the colors look natural.', '2007-07-09 13:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885878, 547502, 71409, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I like the drama here.  ...and the way the eye is drawn to the near tree, then to the distance with the other two.  Good detail in the clouds and field grass without "overdoing" it.  This is one of my favs for this challenge.  And, lastly, I would expect to see this somewhere on a calender, or magazine ad.  Good job.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I like the drama here.  ...and the way the eye is drawn to the near tree, then to the distance with the other two.  Good detail in the clouds and field grass without "overdoing" it.  This is one of my favs for this challenge.  And, lastly, I would expect to see this somewhere on a calender, or magazine ad.  Good job.', '2007-07-09 13:36:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885892, 547455, 71409, '<td valign="top">Too bad it wasn''t advanced editing so you could take out those power lines.  I like the contrast between the red buildings and the yellow/green foilage.  Critiquing, i''d like to see maybe a wider angle, with a little more sky in the reflection in the water...and for some reason the image feels weighted to the left (like it''s not level)... That being said, I also like that it doesn''t look edited.</td>', 'Too bad it wasn''t advanced editing so you could take out those power lines.  I like the contrast between the red buildings and the yellow/green foilage.  Critiquing, i''d like to see maybe a wider angle, with a little more sky in the reflection in the water...and for some reason the image feels weighted to the left (like it''s not level)... That being said, I also like that it doesn''t look edited.', '2007-07-09 13:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885898, 547145, 43548, '<td valign="top">love the pic i only put 5 because it doesn''t really fit the challenge to me</td>', 'love the pic i only put 5 because it doesn''t really fit the challenge to me', '2007-07-09 13:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885903, 547596, 71409, '<td valign="top">I like the colors, smooth lighting, and framing here... I don''t like the light halo around the baloon...</td>', 'I like the colors, smooth lighting, and framing here... I don''t like the light halo around the baloon...', '2007-07-09 13:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885918, 546993, 71409, '<td valign="top">I love the detail in the sky on this.  And the image with the gates works well I think.  However, it doesn''t look smooth between the ground and sky.  Hard to explain, almost looks like maybe the sky has more detail and contrast than the ground??? This is the 3rd time i''ve looked and can''t figure it out.  tough one to vote... 6</td>', 'I love the detail in the sky on this.  And the image with the gates works well I think.  However, it doesn''t look smooth between the ground and sky.  Hard to explain, almost looks like maybe the sky has more detail and contrast than the ground??? This is the 3rd time i''ve looked and can''t figure it out.  tough one to vote... 6', '2007-07-09 13:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885920, 546919, 71409, '<td valign="top">I like the dreamy look here... just wish it were a bit brighter.</td>', 'I like the dreamy look here... just wish it were a bit brighter.', '2007-07-09 13:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885944, 547044, 71409, '<td valign="top">I like the coloring of the sky in this.  Smooth.  Good concept that works with your title.  To critique, I don''t think the image is really outstanding compared to a lot of others.  May would''ve worked well if were cropped portrait on the right side with the sun in the lower/center of the frame.  That way we''d get the sun "burning" through the leaves dominating the frame, with the nice, creamy sky above.</td>', 'I like the coloring of the sky in this.  Smooth.  Good concept that works with your title.  To critique, I don''t think the image is really outstanding compared to a lot of others.  May would''ve worked well if were cropped portrait on the right side with the sun in the lower/center of the frame.  That way we''d get the sun "burning" through the leaves dominating the frame, with the nice, creamy sky above.', '2007-07-09 13:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885955, 548037, 71409, '<td valign="top">Love the shallow depth of field here... Good macro comp.  I also like that you didn''t over edit the bee and flower and over sharpen it.  That being said, I do wish the bee and flower were a little more in focus.  Tough one to vote, because I tend to lean more towards these images that don''t look like they were edited.  5</td>', 'Love the shallow depth of field here... Good macro comp.  I also like that you didn''t over edit the bee and flower and over sharpen it.  That being said, I do wish the bee and flower were a little more in focus.  Tough one to vote, because I tend to lean more towards these images that don''t look like they were edited.  5', '2007-07-09 13:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885962, 547850, 71409, '<td valign="top">I love these shots.  Only critique is it looks like maybe a little too sharpened... That being said, I like all of the lines running thru, the sun hitting the land near, and the cloudscape shadowing the land far.</td>', 'I love these shots.  Only critique is it looks like maybe a little too sharpened... That being said, I like all of the lines running thru, the sun hitting the land near, and the cloudscape shadowing the land far.', '2007-07-09 14:01:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885977, 547682, 71409, '<td valign="top">I like the frame/comp really well.  What turns me off about this is the shadowed land/plants low-left.  I think the shot would''ve worked well if the light was hitting them... If I were there, also I would''ve taking the shot from maybe a foot off the ground to really get some detail of the stream... with a wide lens to keep the top frame you have... <br/> <br/>Tough one - Without the shadowed low-left, I would expect to see this image on a calender, or an outdoors magazine, etc... 5</td>', 'I like the frame/comp really well.  What turns me off about this is the shadowed land/plants low-left.  I think the shot would''ve worked well if the light was hitting them... If I were there, also I would''ve taking the shot from maybe a foot off the ground to really get some detail of the stream... with a wide lens to keep the top frame you have...  Tough one - Without the shadowed low-left, I would expect to see this image on a calender, or an outdoors magazine, etc... 5', '2007-07-09 14:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3885978, 546850, 71409, '<td valign="top">cool capture. I love the contrast, colors, lights...</td>', 'cool capture. I love the contrast, colors, lights...', '2007-07-09 14:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
