(3885995, 547499, 71409, '<td valign="top">Tough one.  I like the image.  By itself the frame works well... just wish there was a little more clarity...</td>', 'Tough one.  I like the image.  By itself the frame works well... just wish there was a little more clarity...', '2007-07-09 14:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3886005, 546786, 71409, '<td valign="top">This is cool.  Perfect framing, composition, camera angle to get the foreground and landscape.  Just looks like the whole image is overexposed a little much... lost some drama.  That being said, being overexposed could work too... gives it a apocalypse look to it... like the bomb just went off.  Tough one to vote... giving a 6</td>', 'This is cool.  Perfect framing, composition, camera angle to get the foreground and landscape.  Just looks like the whole image is overexposed a little much... lost some drama.  That being said, being overexposed could work too... gives it a apocalypse look to it... like the bomb just went off.  Tough one to vote... giving a 6', '2007-07-09 14:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3886011, 547524, 71409, '<td valign="top">Love the colors and the focus looks spot on... I like the non-edited look... and for the challenge :) you''re saying "this is land" and "that''s sea"... submission.</td>', 'Love the colors and the focus looks spot on... I like the non-edited look... and for the challenge :) you''re saying "this is land" and "that''s sea"... submission.', '2007-07-09 14:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
