(3888272, 546786, 67258, '<td valign="top">An apocalyptic scene - a well considered composition combined with bold post-processing that has produced an impressive and powerful photograph.<br/> <br/><i>Edit: spelling!</i> <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-07-11 02:34:08.</i></td>', 'An apocalyptic scene - a well considered composition combined with bold post-processing that has produced an impressive and powerful photograph. Edit: spelling! ', '2007-07-10 08:11:28.000000', '2007-07-11 03:34:08.000000', 1),
(3888273, 546322, 67258, '<td valign="top">This could have sat equally comfortably in the dichotomy challenge and would have garnered the same score of 8 from me.  A very well composed and well executed photograph of an interesting urban landscape.</td>', 'This could have sat equally comfortably in the dichotomy challenge and would have garnered the same score of 8 from me.  A very well composed and well executed photograph of an interesting urban landscape.', '2007-07-10 08:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3888278, 546843, 67258, '<td valign="top">The elements look as though they were acting against you here, but you have produced a pleasing and ''different'' landscape photograph despite  the conditions.  I would have preferred a slightly deeper depth of field so that the tree line was also in focus.</td>', 'The elements look as though they were acting against you here, but you have produced a pleasing and ''different'' landscape photograph despite  the conditions.  I would have preferred a slightly deeper depth of field so that the tree line was also in focus.', '2007-07-10 08:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3888286, 547809, 67258, '<td valign="top">A pleasing composition, and a good photograph for b&amp;w.  The bold, brooding sky is well captured.  I do find myself slightly confused by the lighting, ''though:  the sun appears to be setting on the horizon, yet the highlights and shadows indicate that it is to the right of the photographer.</td>', 'A pleasing composition, and a good photograph for b&w.  The bold, brooding sky is well captured.  I do find myself slightly confused by the lighting, ''though:  the sun appears to be setting on the horizon, yet the highlights and shadows indicate that it is to the right of the photographer.', '2007-07-10 08:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3888290, 547568, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful piece of scenery - this photo illustrates well how man <b>can</b> add to the beauty of an area - without the appealing fences, this would be a very dull scene.  Nicely captured.</td>', 'What a wonderful piece of scenery - this photo illustrates well how man can add to the beauty of an area - without the appealing fences, this would be a very dull scene.  Nicely captured.', '2007-07-10 08:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3888294, 548060, 67258, '<td valign="top">What absolutely wonderful colours!  Those, combined with the gorgeous, almost organic, sweep of the dirt tracks make for an excellent photograph - a real visual treat!</td>', 'What absolutely wonderful colours!  Those, combined with the gorgeous, almost organic, sweep of the dirt tracks make for an excellent photograph - a real visual treat!', '2007-07-10 08:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3888297, 547851, 67258, '<td valign="top">A very appealing pastoral scene, beautifully captured.  The only thing that would have improved it would have been felling the central tree stump - that may have been a step too far....</td>', 'A very appealing pastoral scene, beautifully captured.  The only thing that would have improved it would have been felling the central tree stump - that may have been a step too far....', '2007-07-10 08:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3888349, 545102, 67258, '<td valign="top">What lovely hills!  The sun setting (?) behind the hills has produced a very pleasing effect, although I do feel that the large triangle is just a little too heavy for the scene.</td>', 'What lovely hills!  The sun setting (?) behind the hills has produced a very pleasing effect, although I do feel that the large triangle is just a little too heavy for the scene.', '2007-07-10 08:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
