(3892276, 547317, 67152, '<td valign="top">Jon - what a cool ''rose window'' on that old church.  very cool stuff.  I like the perspective with the church off set to the far left a lot , but I think your image was taken down due to the very bright sky and the softness.  A slightly lower angle and a higher horizon (to get it away from dead center) could really have boosted this one a bunch.  <br/> <br/>Cheers!<br/>Peter<br/> <br/>Here is my quick edit on the shot you entered.  I moved the horizon up by cropping down, I used noise ninja to sharpen (USM) and smooth out the sky at the same time, and I adjusted the colors a bit - to bring up the red and yellow to add more punch...<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=553072" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/67152/thumb/553072.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/67152/thumb/553072.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/67152/thumb/553072.jpg"/></a><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-07-11 07:03:09.</i></td>', 'Jon - what a cool ''rose window'' on that old church.  very cool stuff.  I like the perspective with the church off set to the far left a lot , but I think your image was taken down due to the very bright sky and the softness.  A slightly lower angle and a higher horizon (to get it away from dead center) could really have boosted this one a bunch.   Cheers!Peter Here is my quick edit on the shot you entered.  I moved the horizon up by cropping down, I used noise ninja to sharpen (USM) and smooth out the sky at the same time, and I adjusted the colors a bit - to bring up the red and yellow to add more punch... ', '2007-07-11 07:56:47.000000', '2007-07-11 08:03:09.000000', 0),
