(3892930, 547882, 66597, '<td valign="top">Deb - this did very well for an urban landscape! I''m glad you added that border, as it helps with the lack of negative space above the spire (sorry, just being picky). This really is a lovely photo with a lot of depth. Congrats on another plus 6 score!</td>', 'Deb - this did very well for an urban landscape! I''m glad you added that border, as it helps with the lack of negative space above the spire (sorry, just being picky). This really is a lovely photo with a lot of depth. Congrats on another plus 6 score!', '2007-07-11 10:13:45.000000', NULL, 0),
