(3895181, 546770, 79211, '<td valign="top">Did you actually read them..or do you have some reason for trying to find a fault in everything to do with me or this image. Considering you are being the least helpful, I find it "curious" as to what you are hoping the get from or add by your comments...<br/> <br/>&lt;examples of where I selected "This comment was helpful"&gt;<br/>This would be an awesome shot if it weren''t so dark.<br/> <br/>very beautiful picture. good framing. I wish the rock would be a little more visible as an anchor point and not melt into the reflection<br/> <br/>&lt;/examples of where I selected "This comment was helpful"&gt;<br/></td>', 'Did you actually read them..or do you have some reason for trying to find a fault in everything to do with me or this image. Considering you are being the least helpful, I find it "curious" as to what you are hoping the get from or add by your comments... <examples of where I selected "This comment was helpful">This would be an awesome shot if it weren''t so dark. very beautiful picture. good framing. I wish the rock would be a little more visible as an anchor point and not melt into the reflection </examples of where I selected "This comment was helpful">', '2007-07-11 18:57:50.000000', NULL, 0),
