(3896388, 548011, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is a classic American landscape, as far as I''m concerned. Perhaps the people who didn''t like don''t understand the American mythology of the road. The glass, the mirror, the emptiness, the containing car and the tiny vision of a car, the offramp and the onramp, going, coming and becoming, all are part of this myth. And the mirror reminds us that looking outside is not enough to escape looking at ourselves.<br/> <br/>oh, and I love your b/w conversion. Great clouds and rich darknesses.</td>', 'This is a classic American landscape, as far as I''m concerned. Perhaps the people who didn''t like don''t understand the American mythology of the road. The glass, the mirror, the emptiness, the containing car and the tiny vision of a car, the offramp and the onramp, going, coming and becoming, all are part of this myth. And the mirror reminds us that looking outside is not enough to escape looking at ourselves. oh, and I love your b/w conversion. Great clouds and rich darknesses.', '2007-07-11 23:52:28.000000', NULL, 0),
