(3907519, 547913, 24454, '<td valign="top">Oh yes, this is a STUNNING landscape!   That old yellow mailbox, set off by that field of wildlfowers.   Worthy of wall-hanging material for sure.   I''m glad the voters agreed :)<br/> <br/>I didn''t finish voting on this challenges, so missed this one, but am surprised too that it only received one 10.   Looks like jhamou was the only one who voted just right on this one.   13 others who gave it a 9 got close :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Oh yes, this is a STUNNING landscape!   That old yellow mailbox, set off by that field of wildlfowers.   Worthy of wall-hanging material for sure.   I''m glad the voters agreed :) I didn''t finish voting on this challenges, so missed this one, but am surprised too that it only received one 10.   Looks like jhamou was the only one who voted just right on this one.   13 others who gave it a 9 got close :) ', '2007-07-16 10:39:51.000000', NULL, 0),
